# Store text with LF in the repo. Windows checkouts can keep CRLF locally;
# Cursor's cloud agents (Linux) get LF. Prevents whole-file line-ending diffs.
* text=auto

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.bin binary
*.npz binary
*.npy binary
*.nc binary
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
*.parquet binary
*.wav binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
